      "v": 2,
      "zh": "在耶路撒冷作王三年。他母亲名叫米该亚（又作玛迦），是基比亚人乌列的女儿。亚比雅常与耶罗波安争战。",
      "en": "He ruled for three years in Jerusalem.[NOTE:1] His mother[NOTE:2] was Michaiah, the daughter of Uriel from Gibeah.[NOTE:3] There was war between Abijah and Jeroboam.",
